Not in the early game. If your max HP are below 15 at XL1 and 20 at XL2,
you can simply pray for them. It's a bit of dance, but is reasonably
safe. Here's the technique:

1) Be sure that you can pray.

2) back yourself into a corner with a level 1 monster. Jackals and
kobolds are good for this.

3) Let them drop your HP to below 6.

4) Pray. You'll get a random max HP bump of 1-5 HP along with being
fully healed.

So usually I'll pray for one bump, go to XL2 for another, and if I'm
still below 20 HP, pray for year another.

Healing potions will also bump your max HP, especially blessed ones. Yet
another reason that starting with a healer is a good idea as they come
with healing potions in their pack.

