The most difficult part of the early game are strong fast tough monsters
generated early due to high XLs. soldier ants and mumaks are no joke at
DL7. Even with high HPs, each can take a moderately ACed and burdened
character (or pet) down before you can get rid of them.

I simply posit that in mid game an unburdened, AC -10, XL7 character
with an XL9 pet and full spellcasting ability is better equipped to deal
than a AC 1 (or zero), burdened XL10 one with an XL5 pet and impacted
with spellcasting. The former can run faster, take more hits, and still
have lower level monsters than the latter.


